  "keyFeatures": [
    "Browse Polymarket prediction markets by trending volume or keyword search",
    "Execute on-chain trades via split + CLOB mechanism on Polygon",
    "Track open positions with live P&L calculations",
    "LLM-powered hedge discovery using contrapositive logical implication",
    "Redeem collateral from resolved market positions",
    "OpenClaw skill integration for natural language trading via Claude",
    "Rotating proxy support for Cloudflare-blocked CLOB endpoints",
    "Coverage tier classification (T1–T4) for hedge quality ranking"
